{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":15069,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a4dad6f86a17185c4065175667204271","RawContent":"When I ordered mine through them, they said that they have a lifetime guarantee on the silkscreen. It is supposed to survive anything, including the dishwasher. I would definitely contact them. \n \n What type of mug did you order? I&#039;ve got stainless steel ones, I really hope that the silkscreen lasts!","Attachments":[],"Id":276410,"PostDate":1208874820,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                When I ordered mine through them, they said that they have a lifetime guarantee on the silkscreen. It is supposed to survive anything, including the dishwasher. I would definitely contact them. <br \/> <br \/> What type of mug did you order? I've got stainless steel ones, I really hope that the silkscreen lasts!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;103\/st\/20080508\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-1\/k\/a9f0\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...a9f0\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"erin.sumner@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1187192940,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207621.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"BeachBride82","Id":207621,"Name":"BeachBride82","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":15069,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4622fa0faf1e63bef5db23b99d3da3e4","RawContent":"I ordered mine through this company as well. it&#039;s the travel mug with the handle and the stainless steel around the top. the printing did not come off of ours. I wonder if it&#039;s a difference in the plastic materials?\n I would contact them Heidi. that&#039;s not fair.","Attachments":[],"Id":276548,"PostDate":1208881201,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I ordered mine through this company as well. it's the travel mug with the handle and the stainless steel around the top. the printing did not come off of ours. I wonder if it's a difference in the plastic materials?<br \/> I would contact them Heidi. that's not fair.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"~Trisha~<br \/>\n<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.faberphotography.com'>www.faberphotography.com<\/a><br \/>\n<br \/>\nMy latest destination wedding photos can be found <a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/faberphotography.com\/destination-wedding\