{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62835,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e65349104c9f5a0e2af5046996ccaa41","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Both are beautiful but I like #2.&amp;nbsp; However, like all the other ladies have said you may feel differently once it&#039;s on you.&amp;nbsp; Definitely go to a salon and try on those 2 styles (or all styles) and see which one flatters you more!&amp;nbsp; Good luck!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1579267,"PostDate":1328625362,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Both are beautiful but I like #2.\u00a0 However, like all the other ladies have said you may feel differently once it's on you.\u00a0 Definitely go to a salon and try on those 2 styles (or all styles) and see which one flatters you more!\u00a0 Good luck!!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jaweis8@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1314025110,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-244254.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jamie5280","Id":244254,"Name":"Jamie5280","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible"