e.&amp;nbsp; I am wondering how to attach the starfish though? Has anyone done this or is doing this?&amp;nbsp; I found them premade on etsy for $13 each, but am hoping I can do it myself :)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I&#039;ve attached a pic &lt;img alt=\"starfishchair.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/557126\/width\/310\/height\/300\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1527865,"PostDate":1317393097,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I would like to make some starfish chair decorations that either hang by raffia or ribbon for the chairs along the aisle.\u00a0 I am wondering how to attach the starfish though? Has anyone done this or is doing this?\u00a0 I found them premade on etsy for $13 each, but am hoping I can do it myself <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I've attached a pic <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"starfishchair.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/557126\/width\/310\/height\/300\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mbowling1980@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1293581605,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-234870.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mbowling","Id":234870,"Name":"mbowling","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63832,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a595aafa87661772ddbb4c69e325b6e3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I have started making mine with rafia but I have a different inspiration picture - the star fish is tied in with the ribbon.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"chair decor.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/557314\/width\/525\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1528065,"PostDate":1317417083,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I have started making mine with rafia but I have a different inspiration picture - the star fish is tied in with the ribbon.\u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"chair decor.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/557314\/width\/525\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"janette34@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1289594881,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-233915.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"janette34","Id":233915,"Name":"janette34","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63832,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"12cf6095b70fc7a0169275cc2c6be64f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Are you using real or fake starfish? You could attach a clip to the back (hot glue might work)and then the raffia would just get pinned into it. I think that might work; hopefully it makes sense!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; PS - Love both of these pictures!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1528177,"PostDate":1317426867,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Are you using real or fake starfish? You could attach a clip to the back (hot glue might work)and then the raffia would just get pinned into it. I think that might work; hopefully it makes sense!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> PS - Love both of these pictures!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"krys85418@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.181.124.120","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1301859312,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-238489.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":113,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Peach","Id":238489,"Name":"Peach","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63832,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5b82bc123fbda004396d4c95550157f1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; thanks guys! I like the 2nd pic that was posted now too! I&#039;ve got to order them soon so I&#039;ve got to decide which color to get (the yellowish ones or the white ones) :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1528260,"PostDate":1317469059,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> thanks guys! I like the 2nd pic that was posted now too! I've got to order them soon so I've got to decide which color to get (the yellowish ones or the white ones) <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mbowling1980@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1293581605,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-234870.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mbowling","Id":234870,"Name":"mbowling","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63832,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"66c0f271caafb107c55a5fccb0e2d2ab","RawContent":"Do you prefer fake or real starfish? The yellow ones are sugar starfish and come in very large sizes for dramatic bold effect (as large as 10 - 12 inches), but very hard to find nice, fake ones. On the other hand, you can find nice, fake white pencil starfish.\n \n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]mbowling[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n thanks guys! I like the 2nd pic that was posted now too! I&#039;ve got to order them soon so I&#039;ve got to decide which color to get (the yellowish ones or the white ones) :)[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1528325,"PostDate":1317486980,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Do you prefer fake or real starfish? The yellow ones are sugar starfish and come in very large sizes for dramatic bold\u00a0effect (as large as 10 - 12 inches),\u00a0but very hard to find nice,\u00a0fake ones. On the other hand, you can find nice,\u00a0fake white pencil starfish.<br \/> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>mbowling<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> thanks guys! I like the 2nd pic that was posted now too! I've got to order them soon so I've got to decide which color to get (the yellowish ones or the white ones) <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"pinksapphiregirl@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1304096603,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-239459.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":237,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"redginger","Id":239459,"Name":"redginger","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":63832,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ee47b8f8040a93b7587b1d0e573bba03","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;div style=\"background-color: transparent; \"&gt; &lt;span id=\"internal-source-marker_0.7861260112840682\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap; \"&gt;I would suggest you to buy it from somewhere.......From where you get them on reasonable price.............Making star fish for each chairs if not as easy as you think so..........My friend also tried it but ends up buying them............&lt;\/span&gt;\n &lt;span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap; \"&gt;There are already so many things to do and handle for wedding preparations.........Don\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t include one more........Buy them if you are really getting good deal some where.........&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1529396,"PostDate":1317717790,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style ty