 guests to be able to afford them\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i195.photobucket.com\/albums\/z31\/princezsez\/shell-wine-stoppers.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":92326,"PostDate":1186771681,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Shelly - can you just plan my wedding for me because I love ALL of those pictures! I swear, it's going to be a sad day for starfish when I get married because I want to incorporate them into everything. The only exception is that, like you, I think I want to find a beautiful shell for the rings. <br \/> <br \/> I love these for place cards<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i195.photobucket.com\/albums\/z31\/princezsez\/seashelltrioplacecardholder.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> And these would be great favors because FI and I love wine, but we have way to many guests to be able to afford them<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i195.photobucket.com\/albums\/z31\/princezsez\/shell-wine-stoppers.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i195.photobucket.com\/albums\/z31\/princezsez\/Wedding2-1.jpg\">http:\/\/i195.photobucket.com\/albums\/z...We